sequenceDiagram
    actor Dev as Developer
    participant JSONL as JSONL Files<br/>~/.claude/projects/
    participant Agent as be-agent<br/>(Node.js CLI)
    participant API as Lambda API<br/>(Hono Server)
    participant S3 as S3 Bucket<br/>(ccusage-data)
    participant Agg as Aggregator<br/>Lambda
    participant Dash as Dashboard<br/>(Next.js SPA)

    Note over Dev,JSONL: Developer uses Claude Code normally
    Dev->>JSONL: Claude Code writes<br/>usage data to .jsonl files

    Note over Agent: Triggered by launchd (macOS)<br/>or systemd (Linux) every N minutes

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note over Agent: Phase 1: Collect Data
        Agent->>Agent: loadConfig()<br/>Read ~/.ccusage-agent/config.json
        Agent->>Agent: loadState()<br/>Get file_offsets with fingerprints

        Agent->>JSONL: Scan ~/.claude/projects/*.jsonl<br/>~/.ccs/instances/*/projects/*
        JSONL-->>Agent: File list with sizes

        loop For each .jsonl file
            Agent->>Agent: Check offset vs file size<br/>+ SHA-256 fingerprint
            alt File unchanged (offset == size, fingerprint matches)
                Agent->>Agent: Skip file
            else File grew (offset < size, fingerprint matches)
                Agent->>JSONL: Read from saved offset
                JSONL-->>Agent: New lines only
            else File reset (fingerprint changed)
                Agent->>JSONL: Read from beginning
                JSONL-->>Agent: All lines
            end
            Agent->>Agent: parseJSONLLine()<br/>Extract UsageEntry + PromptEntry
        end

        Agent->>Agent: discoverProjects()<br/>git remote get-url origin
        Agent->>Agent: calculateEntryCosts()<br/>LiteLLM pricing (cached 24h)
    end

    rect rgb(227, 242, 253)
        Note over Agent,API: Phase 2: Push to Server
        loop Entries batched at 1000/request
            Agent->>API: POST /api/sync<br/>{entries[], projects[], prompts[]}
            alt 2xx Success
                API-->>Agent: 200 OK {received, duplicates}
            else 5xx Server Error
                Agent->>Agent: Exponential backoff<br/>2^n x 1s, max 3 retries
                Agent->>API: Retry POST /api/sync
                API-->>Agent: 200 OK
            else 4xx Client Error
                API-->>Agent: 4xx Error
                Agent->>Agent: Fail immediately
            end
        end

        loop Prompts batched at 500/request
            Agent->>API: POST /api/sync<br/>{prompts[]}
            API-->>Agent: 200 OK
        end

        Agent->>Agent: saveState()<br/>Update file_offsets + fingerprints
    end

    rect rgb(187, 222, 251)
        Note over API,S3: Phase 3: Lambda Processes Sync
        API->>S3: Read members/index.json
        S3-->>API: MemberRegistry

        API->>API: Resolve member by email<br/>(create if new, ETag concurrency)

        API->>S3: Read raw/{memberId}/{year}-{month}.json
        S3-->>API: Existing raw data

        API->>API: Dedup entries by request_id<br/>Merge new entries

        API->>S3: Write raw/{memberId}/{year}-{month}.json
        API->>S3: Compute + Write<br/>aggregated/{memberId}/{year}-{month}.json
        API->>S3: Write projects/{memberId}.json
        API->>S3: Write prompts/{memberId}/{year}-{month}.json
        API->>S3: Write sync-logs/{year}-{month}/{memberId}.json
        API->>S3: Update members/index.json<br/>(lastSyncAt, syncCount)
    end

    rect rgb(243, 229, 245)
        Note over Agg: Phase 4: Aggregator (Hourly via EventBridge)
        Agg->>S3: Read members/index.json
        S3-->>Agg: Member list

        loop For each member
            Agg->>S3: Read aggregated/{memberId}/*.json
            S3-->>Agg: Monthly aggregations
        end

        Agg->>Agg: Compute team-wide stats<br/>Model distribution, trends,<br/>rankings, comparisons

        Agg->>S3: Write views/dashboard.json
        Agg->>S3: Write views/members.json

        loop For each member
            Agg->>S3: Write views/members/{id}/{year}.json
        end

        Agg->>S3: Write meta/last-processed.json
    end

    rect rgb(232, 234, 246)
        Note over Dash: Phase 5: Dashboard Renders
        Dash->>API: GET /api/dashboard
        API->>S3: Read views/dashboard.json
        S3-->>API: Dashboard data
        API-->>Dash: JSON response

        Dash->>API: GET /api/members
        API->>S3: Read views/members.json
        S3-->>API: Members data
        API-->>Dash: JSON response

        Dash->>API: GET /api/members/:id?year=2026
        API->>S3: Read views/members/{id}/2026.json
        S3-->>API: Yearly detail
        API-->>Dash: JSON response

        Dash->>Dash: API Adapter transforms response
        Dash->>Dash: Render Recharts visualizations
    end

    Note over Agent,API: Parallel: Command Polling
    Agent->>API: GET /api/agent/commands?email=user@example.com
    API->>S3: Read commands/{memberId}/queue.json
    S3-->>API: Pending commands
    API-->>Agent: Command list

    alt Has pending commands
        Agent->>Agent: Execute command<br/>(revoke-token, force-sync, update)
        Agent->>API: POST /api/agent/commands/:id/ack
        API->>S3: Update command status
    end

    Note over Agent,API: Parallel: Auto-Update Check
    Agent->>API: GET /api/agent/version
    API->>S3: Read releases/version.json
    S3-->>API: Version manifest
    API-->>Agent: {version, downloadUrl}

    alt New version available
        Agent->>S3: Download via presigned URL<br/>ccusage-agent-*.tgz
        S3-->>Agent: Binary package
        Agent->>Agent: npm install -g<br/>Re-run setup + sync --force
    end
